[00:19.050]作词：CY7
[00:19.200]作曲：CY7
[00:19.350]Rain falls softly on the stone (雨轻轻落在石上)
[00:22.350]Tiny hands still shaking alone (她那双小手仍在颤抖)
[00:26.070]Silver skies above her eyes (银灰色的天空映在她眼中)
[00:29.880]No one came to hear her cries (却没有人来听她哭泣)
[00:34.200]Every scar became a line (每一道伤疤都成了痕)
[00:37.290]Carved into her fragile mind (刻进她脆弱的心里)
[00:40.950]Still she tried to stand somehow (可她仍试着站起来)
[00:44.880]Even with her spirit bowed (哪怕灵魂已低垂)
[00:48.360]She kept walking through the pain (她仍在痛里前行)
[00:52.230]Through the fear and through the rain (穿过恐惧，穿过风雨)
[00:55.890]Holding on to one small spark (紧紧抓住那一点微光)
[00:59.640]Hidden deeply in the dark (深深藏在黑暗里)
[01:04.350]Hold the light, don’ t let it fade (守住那光，不要让它熄灭)
[01:08.130]Even when the skies turn gray (即使天空也变得灰暗)
[01:11.820]There’ s a place beyond the storm (风暴之后有一个地方)
[01:14.400]Where broken hearts can still stay warm (破碎的心仍能温暖)
[01:19.320]If the world becomes too hard (若这世界太过艰难)
[01:22.920]Carry hope beneath the scars (就把希望藏在伤痕之下)
[01:27.690]One small flame can guide the way (一点微火也能指引前路)
[01:33.240]Toward another day (走向明天)
[01:56.040]Dust and tears upon the floor (尘土与泪水落满地面)
[01:59.490]She could not endure much more (她已再难承受更多)
[02:03.390]Yet inside her weary chest (可在她疲惫的胸口)
[02:06.990]Something still refused to rest (仍有某种东西不肯沉默)
[02:10.890]Though the nights were filled with grief (尽管夜里满是悲伤)
[02:14.430]Still she searched for some relief (她仍在寻找一丝慰藉)
[02:18.210]Far beyond the endless rain (在那无尽雨幕之外)
[02:21.990]Waited skies she could reclaim (有她终能重回的天空)
[02:25.170]Step by step and breath by breath (一步一步，呼吸相随)
[02:28.800]She survived what should have left (她熬过了本该将她击垮的一切)
[02:32.730]Every wound became a sign (每一道伤口都成了印记)
[02:36.270]She was stronger over time (证明她正变得更坚强)
[02:37.380]Hold the light, don’ t let it fade (守住那光，不要让它熄灭)
[02:44.910]Even when the skies turn gray (即使天空也变得灰暗)
[02:48.570]There’ s a place beyond the storm (风暴之后有一个地方)
[02:51.150]Where broken hearts can still stay warm (破碎的心仍能温暖)
[02:56.940]If the world becomes too hard (若这世界太过艰难)
[02:59.670]Carry hope beneath the scars (就把希望藏在伤痕之下)
[03:02.880]One small flame can guide the way (一点微火也能指引前路)
[03:09.030]Toward another day (走向明天)
[03:13.560]And when the thunder shakes the sky (当雷声震动天穹)
[03:17.220]She will no longer hide (她将不再躲藏)
[03:21.210]All the sorrow she survived (她熬过的所有悲伤)
[03:24.360]Will become the reason why (都会成为答案的理由)
[03:28.380]She can rise beyond the fear (她将越过恐惧)
[03:32.250]Beyond every falling tear (越过每一滴坠落的泪)
[03:35.880]Toward a dawn she’ s never known (奔向她从未见过的黎明)
[03:40.620]Toward a place called home (奔向一个名为家的地方)
[03:59.190]Hold the light, don’ t let it fade (守住光芒，不要让它熄灭)
[04:03.000]Even when the night remains (即使长夜仍未褪去)
[04:06.600]There’ s a fire inside her soul (她灵魂深处那团火焰)
[04:09.300]Still alive and growing whole (仍在燃烧愈发完整)
[04:11.550]Though the rain may never end (尽管雨也许永不停歇)
[04:17.670]She will learn to breathe again (她终将学会再次呼吸)
[04:22.500]One small flame can guide the way (一点微光也能指引方向)
[04:27.570]Toward another day (迈向崭新的一天)